---
import { withBase } from '../lib/with-base';
import AgentMark from './AgentMark.astro';
import { REPO_URL, RELEASES_URL } from '../lib/docs-nav';
---

<footer class="border-t border-line bg-canvas text-sm">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-docs px-gutter md:px-gutter-lg py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-line">
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-ink font-semibold">
          <AgentMark name="sous" size={22} />
          <span>sous</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-faint">副主厨</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          一个长期运行、随叫随到的私人 AI 助理。你和它讨论需求，它自己维护任务、通过 ACP 协议调度 Claude Code / Codex / Cursor / OpenCode / Kiro 去干活，需要时找你审批，完成后汇报。
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs text-faint">
          仓库组织遵循 <a href="https://wokspace.wxian.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted hover:text-ink underline underline-offset-2">wokspace</a> 规范 · <a href={`${REPO_URL}/blob/main/LICENSE`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted hover:text-ink underline underline-offset-2">MIT License</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-faint">站点导航</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
          <li><a href={withBase('/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">首页</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/#scenarios')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">三个使用场景</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/#capabilities')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">核心能力</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/#agents')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">支持的 Agent</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/changelog/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">版本更新日志</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/sitemap.xml')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">Sitemap</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-faint">文档快速入口</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
          <li><a href={withBase('/docs/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">文档首页（7 大分组索引）</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/docs/getting-started/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">5 分钟跑起来：安装与部署 Hub</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/docs/connect-machine/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">接入电脑与配置各家 Agent</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/docs/cli-and-config/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">CLI 与配置文件参考</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/docs/architecture-overview/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">系统架构：Hub/Daemon 与存储</a></li>
          <li><a href={withBase('/docs/faq-troubleshooting/')} class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">FAQ 与常见故障排查</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-2.5">
        <h2 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-faint">开源与发布</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-muted">
          <li>
            <a href={REPO_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">
              GitHub 仓库 ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={RELEASES_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">
              GitHub Releases ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`${REPO_URL}/blob/main/LICENSE`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">
              MIT License ↗
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`${REPO_URL}/blob/main/docs/decisions/README.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors duration-fast">
              架构决策记录 (ADR) ↗
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-faint font-mono">
      <span>Copyright © 2026 XiaoXianThis · Released under the <a href={`${REPO_URL}/blob/main/LICENSE`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-muted hover:text-ink underline underline-offset-2">MIT License</a>.</span>
      <span>Hub thinks · Node acts · Event-sourced in Go &amp; SQLite</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
